From 5a82c83950cec4d0ee2297c1d2154a40fad76aea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zglstudylinux <zglstudylinux@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:51:40 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] t113: add zgl_board BSP with UART3 debug console on PB6/PB7

- zgl_board BSP based on evb1_auto (board.dts, config-5.4, env.cfg,
  sys_config.fex, partitions, bootlogo, amp_dsp0)
- UART3 debug console on PB6/PB7 (mux7) per schematic U24 3P header
- twi3 disabled to free PB6/PB7; earlycon address 0x02500c00 (UART3)
- console=ttyS3,115200 in all three env.cfg sets
